{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_145_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "1eb5497ad4400833e033b60f52581317bebe634831040e190f921ba38b34a7b2", "ja": "うん。だけど、言ってくれたから……\nあの時は、けっこうヘコんじゃったりしたけど。", "zh": "嗯。不过，因为你愿意告诉我……虽然那时候，我确实挺消沉的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_145_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "a27730e520b841e0e6a0716b72cf55082122364328dd994f6dd3c9f061daaf9d", "ja": "今はまた、話せるようになったわけだし。\nホント、よかったなぁ～って思って。", "zh": "现在也能重新聊上了。\n我真的觉得，这样就太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_145_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "0e553403edf3b615a59d22a0466e279dbad842f427d3184b8d967f2863a14d16", "ja": "もちろん、まだぎこちないけど。\nでもやっぱり、ちゃんと向き合うべきなんだなぁって。", "zh": "当然，虽然现在还有点生硬。\n但我还是觉得，果然应该好好去面对呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_145_1031_020meg", "source_sha256": "adc1967ea82226f0425f720584755979886221fd7881b26cb5b7ff646af697b8", "ja": "だから……ほんとありがとね。\nアタシをあの子に向き合わせてくれて。", "zh": "所以……真的谢谢你。\n谢谢你让我面对那孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_145_1032_p", "source_sha256": "e1d1fa3203d2ffb517d3f6731e520e4d0aff8ef4834612f4a0dc617d1e61f452", "ja": "うん。でも恵美はもうそういうの、わかってたよな。", "zh": "嗯。不过惠美其实早就明白那些道理了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_145_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_145_1033_020meg", "source_sha256": "f5b74cbba73048c485bc5da8093f83b2644c761663ca50a926ffc05dc0038072", "ja": "どうかなー？\n……うん、だとしても、今はもっとわかった。", "zh": "不好说吧——？\n……嗯，就算是那样，我现在也更明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
